    "id": "7-1",
    "index": 1,
    "title": "Queue the Payments",
    "from": "Priya, NimbusCart operations",
    "brief": "Checkout is slow: the payment provider takes a quarter of a second and our function waits for it while the customer stares at a spinner. Customers should see 'Order received' in under 140 ms. Every order must still be charged by the end of the day.",
    "lesson": "A queue lets the customer’s request finish as soon as the order is saved. A separate worker takes charges off the queue and calls the slow provider in the background.",
